                    "target": "As curvas monumentais de Oscar Niemeyer em Brasília e na Catedral Metropolitana transformaram o concreto armado em poesia plástica universal.",
                    "reading": "As koor-vas mo-noo-men-tys de Os-kar Nee-e-my-er em Bra-zee-lya...",
                    "translation": "Oscar Niemeyer's monumental curves in Brasília and the Metropolitan Cathedral transformed reinforced concrete into universal plastic poetry."
